# Per-host runtime config with real values — keep .env.example templates only.
**/.env
!**/.env.example

# Machine-local Claude Code permissions (absolute paths, personal allowlists).
# The shareable variant is .claude/settings.json.
**/.claude/settings.local.json

# Hermes Agent writes project-local state (.hermes/) into whatever workspace
# it runs in — skills, attachments, per-project session data. Runtime state,
# not source.
**/.hermes/
